:: Dye Harder Seat
<<if $dhmod.npc is undefined>>
	<<generate2>>
	<p><<person2>><<person>>【이가】 당신이 주문 설명을 채 끝내기도 전에 끼어든다. <<His>> 머리카락은 무지개의 일곱 색으로 물들어 있어, <<he>>【이가】 움직일 때마다 환각적인 무늬를 이룬다. 당신도 미용사도 <<he>>【이가】 어디서 나타났는지 알 수 없다.</p>
	<p>"이 손님은 제가 맡을게요." <<he>>【이가】 미용사의 어깨를 두드리고, 고해상도 화면이 달린 태블릿을 꺼내 든다. 화면에는 약 1,600만 가지 색을 고를 수 있는 색상 선택기만 떠 있다.
	"저는 도전을 좋아해요. 손님은 딱 도전처럼 들리네요."</p>
	<p>당신은 눈을 깜빡인다. "정말 아무 색이나... 그냥 골라도 되나요?"</p>
	<p>"걱정 마세요. 전 전문가거든요 ☆ ～"</p>
<<else>>
	<<set $NPCList[1] to clone($dhmod.npc)>>
	<p>당신이 요청을 입에 올리자마자 <i>전문가</i>가 허공에서 불쑥 나타난다. 미용사는 어깨를 으쓱하고 물러난다.</p>
	<p>"어서 와요, 특별한 손님 ☆ ～" <<person2>><<He>>【은는】 무한한 색의 가능성이 담긴 태블릿을 당신에게 건넨다.</p>
<</if>>
당신은 미용실 의자에 앉아 있다. <i>전문가</i>가 기대에 찬 얼굴로 기다린다.
<<dhmPrices>>

<<set $hairOption to $hairlength>>
<<set $fringeOption to $fringelength>>
<<set $browsDyeOption to "noChange">>
<<set $dyedHairPart to "hair">>
<<set _dhBrightness to [0,0]>>
<<set _pickers to 2>>
<<set $dhmod.tmp.is_custom to true>>
<<set $twoToneHairDye to false>>
<<set $specialTwoToneHairDye to false>>
<<set $moddedTwoToneHairDye to false>>
<<set $moddedTwoToneStyle to moddedTwoToneStyle($hairColourGradient.style)>>

<div class="dhm">
	<div id="hairdresser-options" class="no-numberify settingsGrid">
		<div id="dhmPanel" class="settingsToggleItem">
			<<dhmPanel>>
		</div>

		<div class="settingsToggleItem">
			<<dhmDoll>>
		</div>

		<<for _i to 0; _i lt _pickers; _i++>>
			<<dhmPicker _i>>
		<</for>>
	</div>

	<div id="can-pay">
		<<dhmPayments>>
	</div>
	<<link [[ 포기한다 | Hairdressers ]]>>
		<<endevent>>
		<<unset $dhmod.tmp>>
	<</link>>
</div>
<<run $(() => {
	dhmShop.pickers = [];
	dhmShop.newSession();

	for(let i = 0; i < T.pickers; i++) {
		dhmShop.pickerGen(i);
		dhmShop.syncColorBrightnessSlider(i, dhmod.tmp.brightnessStart[i]);
		dhmShop.syncColorPicker(i, dhmod.tmp.blendStart[i]);
		dhmShop.presetAttachHooks(i);

		$(`#preset-dropdown-toggle-${i}`).click(function(){ $(`#preset-dropdown-container-${i}`).toggle(); });
	}
	$(window).off('resize.dhmShop').on('resize.dhmShop', function(event) { dhmShop.pickerResizeAll(); });
});>>
<br><br>


:: Dye Harder Actually Dying
<!--
apply changes.
the variable gymnastics are not extinct. just more discreet.
-->
<<set _pass to 0>>
<<set _dyeApply to 0>>
<<set _tmp0 to setup.colours.hair_map.tmp0.canvasfilter>>
<<set _tmp1 to setup.colours.hair_map.tmp1.canvasfilter>>
<<if $moddedTwoToneHairDye>>
	<<set _gradient to dhmShop.compileGradient()>>
	<<set _gradient.style to moddedTwoToneStyle($moddedTwoToneStyle)>>
	<<if $dyedHairPart is "fringe" or $dyedHairPart is "hair">>
		<<set $hairFringeColourStyle to "gradient">>
		<<set $hairFringeColourGradient to clone(_gradient)>>
		<<run dhmUtils.fringeGradient([_tmp0, _tmp1])>>
		<<if Math.trunc($fringelength/200) gte 3>><<set _dyeApply += (2 * Math.trunc($fringelength/200))>><</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $dyedHairPart is "sides" or $dyedHairPart is "hair">>
		<<set $hairColourStyle to "gradient">>
		<<set $hairColourGradient to clone(_gradient)>>
		<<run dhmUtils.hairGradient([_tmp0, _tmp1])>>
		<<if Math.trunc($hairlength/200) gte 3>><<set _dyeApply += (5 * Math.trunc($hairlength/200))>><</if>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $specialTwoToneHairDye>>
	<<set _gradient to dhmShop.compileGradient()>>
	<<if $dyedHairPart is "fringe" or $dyedHairPart is "hair">>
		<<set $hairFringeColourStyle to "highlights">>
		<<set $hairFringeColourGradient to clone(_gradient)>>
		<<run dhmUtils.fringeGradient([_tmp0, _tmp1])>>
		<<set $hairFringeColourGradient.style to "highlights">>
		<<if Math.trunc($fringelength/200) gte 3>><<set _dyeApply += (2 * Math.trunc($fringelength/200))>><</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $dyedHairPart is "sides" or $dyedHairPart is "hair">>
		<<set $hairColourStyle to "highlights">>
		<<set $hairColourGradient to clone(_gradient)>>
		<<run dhmUtils.hairGradient([_tmp0, _tmp1])>>
		<<set $hairColourGradient.style to "highlights">>
		<<if Math.trunc($hairlength/200) gte 3>><<set _dyeApply += (5 * Math.trunc($hairlength/200))>><</if>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $twoToneHairDye>>
	<<set _gradient to dhmShop.compileGradient()>>
	<<if $dyedHairPart is "fringe" or $dyedHairPart is "hair">>
		<<set $hairFringeColourStyle to "gradient">>
		<<set $hairFringeColourGradient to clone(_gradient)>>
		<<run dhmUtils.fringeGradient([_tmp0, _tmp1])>>
		<<if Math.trunc($fringelength/200) gte 3>><<set _dyeApply += (2 * Math.trunc($fringelength/200))>><</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $dyedHairPart is "sides" or $dyedHairPart is "hair">>
		<<set $hairColourStyle to "gradient">>
		<<set $hairColourGradient to clone(_gradient)>>
		<<run dhmUtils.hairGradient([_tmp0, _tmp1])>>
		<<if Math.trunc($hairlength/200) gte 3>><<set _dyeApply += (5 * Math.trunc($hairlength/200))>><</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $dyedHairPart is "fringe" or $dyedHairPart is "hair">>
		<<set $hairFringeColourStyle to "simple">>
		<<if Math.trunc($fringelength/200) gte 3>><<set _dyeApply += (2 * Math.trunc($fringelength/200))>><</if>>
		<<run dhmUtils.fringePlain([_tmp0])>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $dyedHairPart is "sides" or $dyedHairPart is "hair">>
		<<set $hairColourStyle to "simple">>
		<<run dhmUtils.hairPlain([_tmp0])>>
		<<if Math.trunc($hairlength/200) gte 3>><<set _dyeApply += (5 * Math.trunc($hairlength/200))>><</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<<run dhmUtils.colorCache()>>

<<set _pass += 30>>
<<unset $dhmod.tmp>>
<p>당신이 선택을 마치자마자 <<He>>【은는】 열정적으로 고개를 끄덕이고 일에 착수해, 선반에서 염색약 통 몇 개를 집어 들고 미친 과학자처럼 용기에 섞는다.</p>
<p>혼합물이 거품을 내며 가라앉자, <<he>>【은는】 그것을 당신의 <<print ({fringe: "앞머리", sides: "옆머리"}[$dyedHairPart] || "머리")>>에 조심스럽게 바른다. <<if _dyeApply gt 0>><span class="blue"><<print ({fringe: "앞머리", sides: "옆머리"}[$dyedHairPart] || "머리")>>【이가】 꽤 길어서 시간이 좀 걸린다.</span><</if>> 화학약품의 날카로운 냄새가 콧속을 찌른다.</p>
<p>"자, 됐어요. 알록달록 예쁘죠. ☆ ～" <<He>>【은는】 정확히 _pass분 뒤에 염색약을 헹궈 내며 자신만만하게 미소 짓는다.</p>
<p>당신은 거울을 본다. 어떻게 된 일인지, 바라던 바로 그 결과가 나왔다. 시술을 마치고도 머리카락은 예상했던 만큼 상하지 않은 것 같다.</p>
<<set _pass += _dyeApply>>
<<pass _pass>>
<<link [[ 떠난다 | Hairdressers ]]>><<endevent>><<unset $dhmod.tmp>><</link>>
